Z||000000||DXR_DAD||03-12-2000||08:22 PM||||This one's for Al!!, Yep two days of it, yesterday I was up at 7:00am, got the coffee going and went outside to do a little cleaning of the black toy <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> show time!! 12:00 time for Horsepower TV and after that I was in the hot tub.....yep AL, the hot tub. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> South San Francisco is clear and sunny today, again so clean the little black toy a little more and put on some look-good parts.<P>What's it like in the rest of the fiero world? Big O reports that it's nice in Modesto so the show sould be nice?? We hope <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
