Z||000004||Robert||03-12-2000||10:21 PM||||You are very right DXR_DAD.  I took a ride out to Pleasanton, old town, and had lunch outdoors in the SUN!  Then drove my car over to George at the Fiero Shop, so he could use it to get to the Modesto Fiero Show next weekend.  I only hope I can pry it away from him after next weekend so I can go the April Fools Rallye the Empire Sports Car Association is putting on April 9.||||reg||1
Z||000005||AL||03-13-2000||01:10 AM||||well i'm happy for you dad, we people in southern calif have been in the sun since thursday, in fact i got up at 6 am saturday to go to the junkyard cause they were having a 50 percent off sale picked up a complete dash and a stereo off another fiero for 13 bucks, it was missing the sub but i'm glad he didn't take the stereo. then i waxed my babies t.a and the gt, and finaly took the top off and went cruising, i admit that after a while i had to turn on my air cause it got nearly to 85, and today the exact same weather. i then decided let's go to the snow, had a blast, the best part of all is that when i wake up i don't have fog in my face, very good weekend, don't you agree dad? you try to stay dry say tuesday. ||||reg||10
